        "2552": {"comment":"DE = 2"},
        "2556": {"synopsis":"SAVE statement's action (keyword descriptor at $388B), continuing past $09FF: an optional\nALL\nword, then the channel $6A opened for the file (CHAN_NAME_ARGS) ...","comment":"The word \"ALL\""},
